WEBVTT

00:10:55.943 --> 00:11:00.717
like MicroMasters
or many bachelor's degrees

00:11:00.717 --> 00:11:03.039
are going to be in place

00:11:03.039 --> 00:11:07.655
because those require less costly, 
less time of the people

00:11:07.655 --> 00:11:09.425
to be able to accomplish that,

00:11:09.425 --> 00:11:12.775
and then maybe the ability 
of really educating more people

00:11:12.775 --> 00:11:14.685
without any further physical space.

00:11:15.426 --> 00:11:19.966
Let's talk a couple of minutes about
research and science and innovation.

00:11:19.966 --> 00:11:25.412
So the Foundation is a key player in Qatar
when it comes to funding

00:11:25.412 --> 00:11:30.109
and creating a context 
for research and innovation.